OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 16 APR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GPianist Elisabeth Leonskaja plays
OL,11,     GBartok & Liszt, the Leonkoro
OL,12,     GQuartet performs Haydn's "Bird"
OL,13,     GQuartet, and The Ulster Orchestra
OL,14,     Gplays music by Sibelius, Stanford
OL,15,     Gand Shostakovich.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Chopin
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod enters the
OL,18,     GParisian world of Frederic
OL,19,     GChopin. Today, cracks begin to
OL,20,     Gshow in Chopin's strange
OL,21,     Grelationship with the writer
OL,22,     GGeorge Sand.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
