OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Martin Hayes Turns the
OL,5,     FTune
OL,6,     GIn conversation with Olivia
OL,7,     GO'Leary, traditional Irish
OL,8,     Gmusician Martin Hayes talks about
OL,9,     Ghis musical hero, the legendary
OL,10,     Gfiddle-player Tommie Potts.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GThis Thursday night, Soweto has
OL,19,     Gmore of the best in jazz from the
OL,20,     GUK and around the world.
